### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "에어팟",
  "price": 190000,
  "stock": 10
}

###

### 전체 상품 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/products

###

### 상품명 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/products/에어팟

###

### 재고 추가
PATCH http://localhost:8080/admin/product/1/stock?quantity=5

###

### 상품 구매
POST http://localhost:8080/buy
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "quantity": 2
  }
]

###

### 여러 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/products